Axiom:
Every token override (where `diff > 1px` between SVG measurement and VKUI default) MUST carry a comment in `.tokens.css`:

```css
/* override: was 8px */
--vkui--size_button_tertiary_small_padding_horizontal_icon--regular: 14px;
```

The comment format is: `/* override: was  */`. This preserves the audit trail — an operator or SpecValidator can verify that the override was intentional and trace it back to the Token Mapping table in the spec.
